; Expect: PlaySound: the sound is 0
; A debug build (-d) stops PlaySound with the 0 of a sound that failed to load. Other builds ignore it, as the original does.
If GetEnv$("BLITZ_SUITE_DEBUG") = "" Then RuntimeError("PlaySound: the sound is 0 (release build, not checked).")
snd = LoadSound("does_not_exist.wav")
PlaySound snd
Print "PlaySound did not stop the program."
